sequenceDiagram
    participant SRC as "Source (CDC / MCP ingress)"
    participant L1 as "L1 Signal Layer"
    participant L2 as "L2 Context Assembly (sole GraphWriter)"
    participant CP as "Control Plane"
    participant L3 as "L3 Context Graph"
    participant A2A as "A2A Inbound Peer"
    participant H as "Harness (via adapter)"

    Note over SRC,L3: Normal write path — the only route into L3 (D-IMPL-41)
    SRC->>L1: source event (CDC change / MCP resource read)
    L1->>L1: normalize into SignalEnvelope (D-IMPL-33, tenant-scoped, no interpretation)
    L1->>L2: SignalEnvelope stream
    L2->>L2: entity resolution (EntityResolutionStrategy, D-IMPL-35)
    L2->>L2: temporal stitching (valid-time vs observed-time)
    L2->>CP: resolve in-force policy bundle version
    CP-->>L2: policy bindings (stamped at assembly time)
    L2->>L3: idempotent upsert via DI-injected GraphWriter (tenant_id, entity_uri)
    L3-->>L2: persisted (set-union lineage, logical supersession)

    Note over A2A,L3: Refused path 1 — A2A inbound never writes L3 directly
    A2A->>CP: inbound Context Product (signed)
    CP->>CP: verify signature, Policy bindings, contract, lineage (D-IMPL-16)
    alt verification passes
        CP->>L2: admit product for assembly
        L2->>L3: write via the same single GraphWriter
    else verification fails
        CP-->>A2A: admission refused (no graph entry)
    end

    Note over H,L3: Refused path 2 — harness holds no write handle
    Note over H: direct L3 write impossible by construction — no GraphWriter exists outside L2 (D-IMPL-41)
    H->>L2: effect capture via governed emission / L2 write-back (D-IMPL-25)
    L2->>L3: write via the same single GraphWriter
